{"version":1,"content":"<p>【生產過程 ㊙️】Mini PC 雖然「細細部」看似簡單，其實生產過程一點也不簡單。</p><p>近日，Beelink 公開了其 SER8 Mini PC 的生產過程，由一塊厚實的圓形原始鋁材展開，歷經外殼 CNC 數位機床切削、表面打磨、噴砂以及陽極氧化等多道繁複金屬工序，再來是主機板 SMT 製程、組裝散熱系統，到整機測試與包裝的完整生產流程全紀錄。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T10:25:43.839007+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:50:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:38:24.048601+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:18:33.885777+00:00","content_hash":"2bc9c705dda299ba47cb28cff81c8e8c28540d03f6eb2c99eb713db3db385c0e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}